  "bio": "André Meleiro, based in the picturesque Lagos, Portugal, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in black and gray styles. His exceptional work can be found at Rockstar Shop Tattoo, where he is known for his remarkable attention to detail and precision in every design he brings to life. Clients appreciate André not only for his artistic prowess but also for the clean and professional environment he maintains, ensuring a safe and inviting experience for everyone who steps through the door.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Lagos, Portugal"
